{"version":1,"content":"<p>西藏那曲市巴青縣22日晚發生7.0級地震，根據西藏日報，巴青縣應急管理局獲悉，縣內全部10個鄉鎮都有震感，距離震中最近的瑪如鄉、崗切鄉震感強烈。</p><p>有西藏居民憶述，地震發生時「人都晃暈了」。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T05:43:51.867846+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":94,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T05:26:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T07:58:11.654953+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T05:38:06.570478+00:00","content_hash":"5552b4599b6628552413505695cc4dd39aa705ff37b54aa636419d61fe9e77d4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}